  2: { explanation: "Biosphere emphasizes the regions where life exists; ecosphere often emphasizes the global system linking life and environment; global ecosystem emphasizes their interacting relationships. These closely related labels shift emphasis; a habitat is only a local living place.", examples: ["The biosphere includes life in the oceans.", "The ecosphere links organisms with their surroundings.", "The global ecosystem includes those interactions."] },
